{"steam_appid":4704520,"steam_name":"ShredDead","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4704520/463353625/66a7258062d0573e2e5d130e10a6656d5e7f2b33/1783678537/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1783678840","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257344404/cdb6d4ef721f2b7e0e2825403ba8bb88e715e3a1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1783678840","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/9aa9497e719388780e90e0aca470bdd282c846a9/ss_9aa9497e719388780e90e0aca470bdd282c846a9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793034266","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/5a892f56a10db3e1523809198539d8d987477c79/ss_5a892f56a10db3e1523809198539d8d987477c79.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793034266","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/fec04ecf422ef2949dd55e7e6b70ef73b33f2873/ss_fec04ecf422ef2949dd55e7e6b70ef73b33f2873.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793034266","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/21e786bf664da457593990715e3e88d3b1b344d0/ss_21e786bf664da457593990715e3e88d3b1b344d0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793034266","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/9fa8d7d6d6f8f45010001f5ec80801b179d3d88d/ss_9fa8d7d6d6f8f45010001f5ec80801b179d3d88d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793034266"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as you know it is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dreaded zombie apocalypse has arrived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are ready to make your last stand and go down in a blaze of glory…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROBLEM IS, you’re too good at this asymmetric warfare thing, and this “last stand” is taking forever. At this point, this is not about survival — this is about <strong>FUN</strong>. Shoot them, burn them, blow them up, and, if all else fails, <strong>SHRED THE DEAD</strong> — with your very own heavy-duty industrial shredder, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.poster.avif?t=1793034266\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.webm?t=1793034266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.mp4?t=1793034266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZOMBIE BLENDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into a flow state of methodically decimating the unending deluge of zombies — or have your grunts do it for you! Or both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.poster.avif?t=1793034266\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.webm?t=1793034266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.mp4?t=1793034266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRANCHING OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you turn more and more zombies into mincemeat, explore the vast skill tree to optimize the killing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.poster.avif?t=1793034266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.webm?t=1793034266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.mp4?t=1793034266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOCK AND LOAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kit your grunts out with the best toys you can get your hands on — after all, zombies are nice enough to deliver the loot right to your doorstep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.poster.avif?t=1793034266\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.webm?t=1793034266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.mp4?t=1793034266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE THE YUCK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are known to evolve, but evolution is boring and takes too long. Why not have your mad scientist speed it up a little? With predictably gross results, of course!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo 2.40 GHz / AMD Athlon 2.40 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Weird Penguin Games"],"publishers":["Weird Penguin Games"],"release_date":"Oct 26, 2026"}